'''Tengu Mountain''' (Japanese: '''天狗山''' ''Tengu Mountain'') is a location in the land of [[Kitakami]]. It exclusively appears in {{aniseries|HZ}}.

Tengu Mountain first appeared near the end of ''[[HZ068|Into a New Sky! The Brave Olivine!]]'', where [[Perrin]] was seen taking a picture of [[Lucius]]'s {{TP|Lucius|Kleavor}}. In ''[[HZ072|The Search for Kleavor!]]'', Perrin led [[Liko]], [[Roy]], [[Dot]], and [[Friede]] to Tengu Mountain to track down Kleavor. Using the clues provided from Perrin's photo, which are a specific kind of plant and a {{p|Dugtrio}}-shaped rock, and the axe markings left by Kleavor, the [[Rising Volt Tacklers]] were able to narrow down where Kleavor currently resided to a Dugtrio-shaped rock near the wetlands. 
